id: pm-swarm-packed-cleanup
title: Harden packed non-Git fixture cleanup against Bun cache races
description: "Fresh handoff CI run 39497758293 on e68da81 reports ENOTEMPTY while removing the non-Git packed acceptance fixture Bun cache. Both review fixes pass the full local npm release gate and the earlier full CI Bun gate; Node 22 also passes the handoff run. The Git packed fixture already awaits recursive fs.rm with bounded retries, following the same historical cleanup race recorded on pm-swarm-watch. Investigate child/cache quiescence and extend bounded cleanup handling to the non-Git fixture without hiding command failures. Keep this separate from the unclaimed-lane and Bun-prerequisite review fixes."
type: Chore
status: open
priority: 2
