acceptance_criteria: "Non-Git packed acceptance reliably removes disposable Bun cache state under concurrent cache cleanup; preserve original command assertions, full npm and Bun gates and unchanged thresholds/timeouts."
parent: pm-swarm-shared-tracker
comments[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-20T21:16:06.241Z",codex-agent,"Deduplicated against ENOTEMPTY and Bun cleanup tracker searches. The historical Git packed fixture cleanup correction is recorded on closed pm-swarm-watch; this new item tracks the equivalent non-Git fixture, which currently lacks bounded retries. Handoff CI run 39497758293 on e68da81 first passed Node 22 but failed Node 26 packed acceptance 2/3 solely at recursive scratch Bun-cache cleanup. The unchanged-code retry passes Node 22/26, including Node 26 packed acceptance and the complete Bun release gate, 155/155 source plus 3/3 packed. This is a real intermittent fixture cleanup failure, not a timeout or a passing first attempt. No source, test, deadline or threshold was changed for the retry. Leave this follow-up open for separate cleanup hardening."
